{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台慶劇《璀璨之城》今晚（27日）迎來高潮，江美儀為保吳卓羲平安不惜向張智霖當眾下跪認罪。三人敗走郊外舊居後張曦 …</p><p></p>\n<p>台慶劇《璀璨之城》今晚（27日）迎來高潮，江美儀為保吳卓羲平安不惜向張智霖當眾下跪認罪。三人敗走郊外舊居後張曦雯竟因居住環境惡劣而大發雷霆。這場豪門恩怨背後隱藏着足以令整個官家徹底崩潰駭人算計。\n</p>\n<h2>江美儀遭張智霖踩入精神病院挑釁</h2>\n<p>官孝賢為奪取尚利鋒主席之位並獨吞遺產而設計陷害官孝君，更手握官詩雅偷食短片以脅迫其抹黑官孝君誠信。他為了逼出股份轉讓書特意前往精神病院接丁麗明回家，並一臉得戚透露已把官孝君逼上絕路。官孝賢陰森嘲諷丁麗明精神狀況，徹底激怒對方失控拽住其衫領，兩大演技派正面交鋒讓緊張氣氛瞬間推向頂點。</p>\n<h2>江美儀霸氣重返官家 為保子女當眾下跪認罪</h2>\n<p>丁麗明隨後剪了一頭俐落短髮並身穿白色西裝霸氣重返官家，得知官孝賢意圖後竟做出驚人舉動，當眾下跪認錯直指自己毒死母親，並願意交出股份以換取子女平安。官孝賢全程默不作聲僅以眼神暗中思索真偽，直到官孝君聽從母親建議答應放棄爭奪並收手離開，他才冷笑一聲扶起丁麗明。這場表面看似屈服實為測試與反擊官孝賢計策展現出極深城府。\n</p>\n<h2>江美儀護仔怒斥張曦雯冇用 暫住舊居原來另有玄機</h2>\n<p>丁麗明與官孝君、張曦雯三人敗走香港後，投靠官孝君爺爺的昔日秘書，暫住其位於郊外的舊居。大屋環境簡陋，令張曦雯大為不滿，當場向官孝君發難，質問是否奶奶要求三人同住。丁麗明眼見兒子遭喝斥，隨即起身反擊，怒斥張曦雯多年來未能幫上丈夫半點忙，更一邊破口大罵，一邊將她推向門口，直斥她阻手阻腳，婆媳衝突瞬間爆發。不過，預告揭露三人選擇在此落腳原來另有玄機：爺爺昔日斥資10億元購入的股票，如今價值已升至原來的400倍，總值高達4000億元！</p>\n<h2>江美儀變臉演技獲網民激讚</h2>\n<p>兩大演技派這場精彩絕倫試探與反擊播出後迅速引起網絡熱烈討論。大批網民紛紛留言大讚江美儀與張智霖大鬥演技擦出火花，直指這幕對峙場面張力十足。有粉絲激動表示「想睇佢點同Chilam鬥」，亦有觀眾留言稱讚江美儀情緒秒切換非常震撼，瘋癲大笑秒變霸氣眼神展現出高超演技水平。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311153256941728_7436737636ae0b5edb5396.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀與張智霖正面交鋒（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311153256941728_7436737636ae0b5edb5396.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀與張智霖正面交鋒（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311153657759236_654988906ae0b5f0f1dad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀遭張智霖踩入精神病院挑釁，激動得一手扯住對方衫領。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311153657759236_654988906ae0b5f0f1dad.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀遭張智霖踩入精神病院挑釁，激動得一手扯住對方衫領。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17931115395838082_20223592446ae0b5f3f26e8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀剪短髮兼換上白色西裝，霸氣重返官家。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17931115395838082_20223592446ae0b5f3f26e8.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀剪短髮兼換上白色西裝，霸氣重返官家。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154191291713_11422531796ae0b5f652e69.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀放下尊嚴跪地認罪，更提出交出股份換取子女平安。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154191291713_11422531796ae0b5f652e69.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀放下尊嚴跪地認罪，更提出交出股份換取子女平安。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154393969944_2864433466ae0b5f83215a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154393969944_2864433466ae0b5f83215a.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154637648812_648656306ae0b5fae61ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154637648812_648656306ae0b5fae61ce.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311155582536716_11733331766ae0b60458b32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀怒斥張曦雯多年來幫唔到丈夫（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311155582536716_11733331766ae0b60458b32.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀怒斥張曦雯多年來幫唔到丈夫（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311155964218886_4139050526ae0b6080dadc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀一邊鬧一邊推向門口。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311155964218886_4139050526ae0b6080dadc.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀一邊鬧一邊推向門口。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508782_y_16631089566ae0bb1b9d3d3-1024x566.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀看似敗走實則留有後路，預告揭露爺爺竟有一筆驚人秘密資金（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508782_y_16631089566ae0bb1b9d3d3-1024x566.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀看似敗走實則留有後路，預告揭露爺爺竟有一筆驚人秘密資金（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508779_y_712368686ae0ba31a7194-1024x566.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 爺爺原來暗藏巨額資產，昔日斥資10億買入的股票，揸到今日竟已升值400倍！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508779_y_712368686ae0ba31a7194-1024x566.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>爺爺原來暗藏巨額資產，昔日斥資10億買入的股票，揸到今日竟已升值400倍！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508781_y_12634100296ae0bb1dd4dd6-1024x566.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 爺爺當年用10億買入股票，持有至今升值400倍（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508781_y_12634100296ae0bb1dd4dd6-1024x566.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>爺爺當年用10億買入股票，持有至今升值400倍（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508780_y_1803007306ae0bb20edbb1-1024x566.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508780_y_1803007306ae0bb20edbb1-1024x566.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%99%ba%e9%9c%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張智霖</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b1%9f%e7%be%8e%e5%84%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">江美儀</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%92%80%e7%92%a8%e4%b9%8b%e5%9f%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">璀璨之城</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531278\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:41:41.103408+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1534,"images":12,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:33:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:34.039273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:36.519659+00:00","content_hash":"d97a06abf93f3c72554375ad3cb4a83fa52abf00f4eb1c728988d022f537de46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}